{
  "description": "Terminal emulator scenario corpus for the spocky-terminal emulator decision. Each scenario feeds PTY output bytes into an emulator sized rows x cols with 1000 lines of scrollback. Ops: text (UTF-8 bytes of the string), hex (raw bytes), repeat (text with %d replaced by the zero-based index, count times, as one chunk), resize (cols, rows). Bytes reach the emulator chunk by chunk exactly as listed. Scenarios after the first 16 (the terminal-emulator decision memo corpus) each exercise ported InputHandler, parser, buffer, reflow and exception branches.",
